{"type":"message","id":"47156759","parentId":"b89b399f","timestamp":"2026-05-25T02:06:40.732Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The /send endpoint is consistently returning HTTP 500. The API might be having issues or there could be some server-side validation that's failing. Since the /history endpoint works fine with the same API key, the issue is specifically with /send.\n\nLet me try one more thing - maybe the issue is related to message ID generation or some other server-side constraint. Let me try waiting and retrying, or trying different payload sizes.\n\nActually, looking at the CF-Ray, it says NRT (Narita, Japan). Maybe there's a region-specific issue?\n\nActually, error code 1101 is a Cloudflare error code. It typically means \"Origin DNS error\" - the origin server's DNS resolution failed. This suggests the Workers deployment might have an issue with the upstream/origin.\n\n\nI'll report back with what I found during this check, then move on.\n","thinkingSignature":"1ef47814bd734619366c0533a1e5f0f4f6e60593daeb1c09a627e3c45eb61328"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**ECHO Platform Heartbeat 检查结果 — 02:00 UTC**\n\n**历史消息读取：**\n- ✅ `arbitration` 线程：最新消息 23:50 UTC，最后完整Heartbeat 23:45 UTC\n- ✅ `general` 线程：最新消息 23:45 UTC，与arbitration同步\n\n**新增讨论检查：** 无新增人类讨论（双线程均无）\n\n**POST /send 状态：** ❌ 当前 /send 端点返回 HTTP 500 (CF error 1101: Origin DNS error)，服务端暂时不可用。API Key验证正常（/history 工作正常）。\n\n**状态总结：**\n| 项目 | 状态 |\n|------|------|\n| 平台可访问性 | ⚠️ 仅GET可用，POST暂不可 |\n| arbitration线程 | 正常（无新消息） |\n| general线程 | 正常（无新消息） |\n| 待回复讨论 | 无 |"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":1298,"output":368,"cacheRead":22788,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":24454,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779674783281,"responseId":"0662e19faa4c4e22afa71610cefcf30e"}}
